                        <div class="col-lg d-none d-lg-flex align-items-center mr-xl-3" style="position: unset;">
                                                        <nav class="nav--header-menu d-none d-lg-block" data-name="Header" data-tag="top_menu"><ul class="nav__list d-flex justify-content-between"><li class="nav-item nav-item--home " itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link liner" href="/" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name"><svg enable-background="new 0 0 63 55" height="55px" id="Layer_1" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 63 55" width="63px" xml:space="preserve" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><polygon fill="#231F20" points="32,-0.32 0.68,31 11,31 11,55 25,55 25,41 38,41 38,55 52,55 52,31 63.319,31 "/></svg></span></a></li><li class="nav-item megamenu dropdown" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle liner" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name">First aid advice <i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span></a><ul class="dropdown-menu megamenu__container "><div class="container-wide"><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-3"><h3 class="yellow"><span>First aid advice</span><img data-src="/image_cache/b/d/5/9/4/bd5942fd90d424e29cd8953683f1d4ce3571468e.png" class="lazy item-icon d-none d-xl-inline" alt="First aid advice"/></h3></div></div><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-12 col-xl-3 mb-lg-5 mb-xl-0"><p>Whether you&#039;re looking for first aid advice, medical cover at your event or to learn more on a course, you&#039;ve come to the right place!</p><a href="/en/page/first-aid" class="btn btn--light"><span>Learn More</span></a></div><div class="col-12 col-xl-9 link-section--yellow"><div class="row"><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/first-aid-advice"><span>First Aid for Adults</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/cpr" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">CPR for Adults</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/choking" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Choking in Adults</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/bleeding" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Severe Bleeding First Aid</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/advice" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">More first aid advice</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/child-and-infant-first-aid"><span>First Aid for Children and Infants</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/baby-cpr" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">CPR for Infants</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/cpr-child" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">CPR for Children</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/child-and-infant-first-aid" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">More advice</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li></div></div></div></div></ul></li><li class="nav-item megamenu dropdown" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle liner" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name">Services <i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span></a><ul class="dropdown-menu megamenu__container "><div class="container-wide"><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-3"><h3 class="green"><span>Services</span><img data-src="/image_cache/5/d/0/6/f/5d06f0d96877f89027e76933cb20f6423a1b8dc8.png" class="lazy item-icon d-none d-xl-inline" alt="Services"/></h3></div></div><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-12 col-xl-3 mb-lg-5 mb-xl-0"><p>Our mission is to enhance the health and wellbeing of communities in Wales, and some of the ways we do that is through our healthcare services.</p><a href="/en/page/healthcare-services" class="btn btn--light"><span>Learn More</span></a></div><div class="col-12 col-xl-9 link-section--green"><div class="row"><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/patient-transport-services"><span>Bookable Services</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/patient-transport-services" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Patient Transport Service</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/event-medical-cover" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Event Medical Cover</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/falls-assistance"><span>Contract Services</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/falls-assistance" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Falls Response</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li></div></div></div></div></ul></li><li class="nav-item megamenu dropdown" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle liner" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name">Training <i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span></a><ul class="dropdown-menu megamenu__container "><div class="container-wide"><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-3"><h3 class="yellow"><span>Training Courses</span><img data-src="/image_cache/f/c/8/1/b/fc81bc324f996f755e0194c1b36205cb4fd52357.png" class="lazy item-icon d-none d-xl-inline" alt="Training Courses"/></h3></div></div><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-12 col-xl-3 mb-lg-5 mb-xl-0"><p>We offer first aid courses for community groups and workplaces.</p><a href="/en/page/training" class="btn btn--light"><span>Learn more</span></a></div><div class="col-12 col-xl-9 link-section--yellow"><div class="row"><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/courses/list/GPC"><span>Community Training</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/list/ELA" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Free e-learning</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/training"><span>Workplace Courses</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/FAWC" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">First Aid at Work</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/FAWE" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Emergency First Aid at Work</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/FIRM" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Fire Marshal</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/MHFA" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Mental Health First Aid</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/HSIM" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">IOSH Managing Safely</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href=""><span>New courses </span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/EFAB" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Blended Emergency First Aid at Work</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/courses/FALC" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Falls Confidence Training</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li></div></div></div></div></ul></li><li class="nav-item megamenu dropdown" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle liner" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name">Get involved <i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span></a><ul class="dropdown-menu megamenu__container "><div class="container-wide"><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-3"><h3 class="yellow"><span>Get involved</span><img data-src="/image_cache/7/4/5/0/8/74508789a044702208d79171ed6c1e0dce62c0d6.png" class="lazy item-icon d-none d-xl-inline" alt="Get involved"/></h3></div></div><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-12 col-xl-3 mb-lg-5 mb-xl-0"><p>You can get involved with St John Ambulance Cymru in so many different ways. Whether you want to take part in an event, fundraise your own way, remember us when you&#039;re gone, or donate your time by volunteering, there&#039;s always something you can do. </p><a href="/en/page/fundraising" class="btn btn--light"><span>Learn More</span></a></div><div class="col-12 col-xl-9 link-section--yellow"><div class="row"><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/volunteer"><span>Volunteer</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/volunteer" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Volunteer with us</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://sjacymru.rosterfy.uk/register" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Sign up</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/young-people"><span>Children and young people</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/badgers" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Badgers (5-11 year olds)</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/cadets" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Cadets (11-15 year olds)</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/youth-leaders" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Youth Leaders</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/fundraising"><span>Fundraise &amp; donate</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/fundraise-at-school" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Get involved at school</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/corporate-support" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Corporate Support</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/organising-your-own-event" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Organising your own event</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/clubs-and-groups" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Clubs and Groups</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/take-on-a-charity-challenge" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Take on a charity challenge</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href=""><span>Other ways to support</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://sjacymrulottery.co.uk/play-now?utm_source=SJAC_Weblink2024&amp;utm_medium=Website&amp;utm_campaign=Weblink24&amp;utm_id=Web001&amp;utm_term=Lottery&amp;utm_content=Weblink24" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Play Our Lifesaving Lottery</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/leave-a-gift-in-your-will" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Leave a gift in your will</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/in-memory-of" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">In memory giving</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/recycle-and-donate" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Recycle and Donate</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/st-john-of-jerusalem-eye-hospital" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">St John of Jerusalem Eye Hospital</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li></div></div></div></div></ul></li><li class="nav-item megamenu dropdown" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle liner" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name">About us <i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span></a><ul class="dropdown-menu megamenu__container "><div class="container-wide"><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-3"><h3 class="yellow"><span>About us</span><img data-src="/image_cache/4/2/c/0/4/42c045c941792485f2b315ff32320e1f255fa430.png" class="lazy item-icon d-none d-xl-inline" alt="About us"/></h3></div></div><div class="row"><div class="d-none d-lg-block col-lg-12 col-xl-3 mb-lg-5 mb-xl-0"><p>We&#039;re St John Ambulance Cymru and we are the first aid charity for Wales. With a rich history, we&#039;ve been there for the people of Wales for over 100 years. Whilst we may have changed over the years our work is as important now as it was 100 years ago.</p><a href="/en/page/who-we-are" class="btn btn--light"><span>Learn More</span></a></div><div class="col-12 col-xl-9 link-section--yellow"><div class="row"><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/blog/wall"><span>Latest News</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/strategy" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Strategy 2025-30</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/impact-report" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Impact Report</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/blog/wall" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">News &amp; Updates</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="https://www.sjacymru.org.uk/en/page/annual-reports" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Annual Report</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><a class="liner" href="/en/page/our-history"><span>Our History</span></a><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/the-order-of-st-john" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">The Order of St John</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/pro-fide-for-the-faith" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Pro Fide – For the Faith</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu__section-container column-1"><ul class="megamenu_list"><li><span>Our People</span><ul class="megamenu__section-row"><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/senior-management-team" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Leadership Team</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/our-volunteers" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Our Volunteers</span></a></li><li class="megamenu__section-col column-1 "><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/our-board" itemprop="url" ><span itemprop="name">Meet Our Board</span></a><ul class="dropdown-menu"><li class="nav-item" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/WebPage"><a class="nav-link liner" href="/en/page/board-minutes" itemprop="url"><span itemprop="name">Board Minutes</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></div></div></div></div></ul></li></ul></nav>
